ar·yah","gloss":"Zechariah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":43},{"base":"H3389","lemma":"יְרוּשָׁלִַ֫ם, יְרוּשְׁלֵם","tr":"ye·ru·sha·laim","gloss":"Jerusalem","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":643},{"base":"H8083","lemma":"שְׁמֹנֶה","tr":"she·mo·neh","gloss":"eight","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":109},{"base":"H5892","lemma":"עִיר","tr":"ir","gloss":"excitement","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":1090}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"GEN","chapter":38,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then she gave birth to another son and named him Shelah; it was at Chezib that she gave birth to him.","from":5},{"book":"GEN","chapter":38,"verse":29,"verseEnd":29,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"But when he pulled his hand back and his brother came out, she said, “You have broken out first!” So he was named Perez.","from":4},{"book":"NUM","chapter":26,"verse":20,"verseEnd":20,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Judah by their clans: The Shelanite clan from Shelah, the Perezite clan from Perez, and the Zerahite clan from Zerah.","from":5},{"book":"RUT","chapter":4,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Now these are the generations of Perez: Perez was the father of Hezron,","from":4},{"book":"1CH","chapter":4,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"The sons of Shelah son of Judah: Er the father of Lecah, Laadah the father of Mareshah and the clans of the linen workers at Beth-ashbea,","from":5},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":1,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"So all Israel was recorded in the genealogies written in the Book of the Kings of Israel. But Judah was exiled to Babylon because of their unfaithfulness. Now the first to resettle their own property in their cities were Israelites, priests, Levites, and temple servants. Some of the descendants of Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim, and Manasseh who lived in Jerusalem:","from":3},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":3,"verseEnd":3,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Some of the descendants of Judah, Benjamin, Ephraim, and Manasseh who lived in Jerusalem:","from":4},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":4,"verseEnd":9,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Uthai son of Ammihud, the son of Omri, the son of Imri, the son of Bani, a descendant of Perez son of Judah. From the Shilonites: Asaiah the firstborn and his sons. From the Zerahites: Jeuel and 690 relatives. From the Benjamites: Sallu son of Meshullam, the son of Hodaviah, the son of Hassenuah; Ibneiah son of Jeroham; Elah son of Uzzi, the son of Michri; Meshullam son of Shephatiah, the son of Reuel, the son of Ibnijah;","from":4}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":5},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":3}]},"10-19":{"people":[{"id":"jachin-h3199i","name":"Jachin","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"jedaiah-h3048g","name":"Jedaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"joiarib-h3114g","name":"Joiarib","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":10},{"id":"hilkiah-h2518h","name":"Hilkiah","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"meraioth-h4812g","name":"Meraioth","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"seraiah-h8304h","name":"Seraiah","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"shallum-h7967l","name":"Shallum","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zadok-h6659i","name":"Zadok","kind":"person","brief":"High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"zerahiah-h2228g","name":"Zerahiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":11},{"id":"adaiah-h5718i","name":"Adaiah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firstVerse":12},{"id":"amzi-h0557h","name":"Amzi","kind":"person","brief":"Returned priest","count":1,"firs