 Hilkiah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Zadok, the son of Meraioth, the son of Ahitub, the chief official of Godʼs temple;","from":11},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":12,"verseEnd":13,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Adaiah son of Jeroham, the son of Pashhur, the son of Malchijah; Maasai son of Adiel, the son of Jahzerah, the son of Meshullam, the son of Meshillemith, the son of Immer; and 1,760 of their relatives, the heads of their families, able men for the work of the service of the house of God.","from":12},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":14,"verseEnd":14,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"From the Levites: Shemaiah son of Hasshub, the son of Azrikam, the son of Hashabiah, a descendant of Merari;","from":15}],"notes":[],"groups":[]},"20-24":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":20},{"id":"gishpa-h1658","name":"Gishpa","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"ziha-h6727h","name":"Ziha","kind":"person","brief":"Returned from exile","count":1,"firstVerse":21},{"id":"asaph-h0623g","name":"Asaph","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"bani-h1137o","name":"Bani","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"hashabiah-h2811o","name":"Hashabiah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Mattaniah","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"mattaniah-h4983o","name":"Mattaniah","kind":"person","brief":"Returned musician","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"mica-h4316i","name":"Mica","kind":"person","brief":"Returned leader","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"uzzi-h5813k","name":"Uzzi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Bani","count":1,"firstVerse":22},{"id":"meshezabel-h4898i","name":"Meshezabel","kind":"person","brief