s":0,"source":"tsk","text":"These were the descendants of Judah by their clans: The Shelanite clan from Shelah, the Perezite clan from Perez, and the Zerahite clan from Zerah.","from":24},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":15,"verseEnd":15,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal, and Mattaniah son of Mica, the son of Zichri, the son of Asaph;","from":22},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":16,"verseEnd":32,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Obadiah son of Shemaiah, the son of Galal, the son of Jeduthun; and Berechiah son of Asa, the son of Elkanah, who lived in the villages of the Netophathites. These were the gatekeepers: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman, and their relatives. Shallum was their chief; he was previously stationed at the Kingʼs Gate on the east side. These were the gatekeepers from the camp of the Levites. Shallum son of Kore, the son of Ebiasaph, the son of Korah, and his relatives from the Korahites were assigned to guard the thresholds of the Tent, just as their fathers had been assigned to guard the entrance to the dwelling of the LORD. In earlier times Phinehas son of Eleazar had been in charge of the gatekeepers, and the LORD was with him.","from":22},{"book":"1CH","chapter":9,"verse":33,"verseEnd":33,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Those who were musicians, the heads of Levite families, stayed in the temple chambers and were exempt from other duties because they were on duty day and night.","from":23},{"book":"1CH","chapter":18,"verse":17,"verseEnd":17,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; and Davidʼs sons were chief officials at the kingʼs side.","from":24},{"book":"1CH","chapter":23,"verse":28,"verseEnd":28,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"but their duty was to assist the descendants of Aaron with the service of the house of the LORD, being responsible for the courts and chambers, the purification of all the holy things, and the work of the service of the house of God,","from":24}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"patriarchs","title":"The patriarchal families","people":3}]},"25-36":{"people":[{"id":"judah-h3063g","name":"Judah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"benjamin-h1144g","name":"Benjamin","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":2,"firstVerse":31},{"id":"levi-h3878","name":"Levi","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Israel","count":1,"firstVerse":36}],"places":[{"id":"dibon-h1769h","name":"Dibon","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"hebron-h2275a","name":"Hebron","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"jekabzeel-h3343","name":"Jekabzeel","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":25},{"id":"beth-pelet-h1046","name":"Beth-pelet","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"jeshua-h3442m","name":"Jeshua","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"moladah-h4137","name":"Moladah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":26},{"id":"beersheba-h0884","name":"Beersheba","kind":"place","brief":"","count":2,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"hazar-shual-h2705","name":"Hazar-shual","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":27},{"id":"meconah-h4368","name":"Meconah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"ziklag-h6860","name":"Ziklag","kind":"place","brief":"In Philistia","count":1,"firstVerse":28},{"id":"ain-h5871h","name":"Ain","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"jarmuth-h3412g","name":"Jarmuth","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"zorah-h6881","name":"Zorah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":29},{"id":"adullam-h5725","name":"Adullam","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"azekah-h5825","name":"Azekah","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"lachish-h3923","name":"Lachish","kind":"place","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":30},{"id":"topheth-h8612","name":"Topheth","kind":"place","brief":"Pagan wo